Hello there, I'm Pratyay Mustafi, a typical *professional amateur*
who wanders around the Internet, and interested in linux,
video games, technology in general and reading/listening to classical literature.
Here you can only read the technical stuff but that's not just some thing I am only interested in.
I usually spend my days on reddit arguing with anons and sometimes I contribute to open source projects.
I generally waste my precious time editing, managing, tinkering with my [dotfiles]($link.url('https://github.com/Pratyay360/dotfiles'))
and Re imagining solutions to problems that don't even exist for most of the people.
Occasionally I brick my devices by over tinkering. I have good sense of humor, but the bad part is I crack dirty jokes with bad timing.
I have a bad habit of repeating myself on some things i am doing but not happening in the way i want it to.
Anyways, read more about me or what I do from this page.
